  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Migrant Information Centers - Support for the Social Inclusion of Migrants in Bulgaria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to national commitments to support the integration and social inclusion of third-country nationals (TCNs) by extending assistance to legally residing TCNs, including asylum seekers and individuals granted international or temporary protection. It will facilitate their access to health, psychosocial, employment, and administrative services in Bulgaria. In addition to initial counseling and livelihood support for the most vulnerable individuals, the project will offer services such as guidance on labor market inclusion, housing support, language classes, and access to healthcare for migrants from diverse origins and legal backgrounds residing in Bulgaria.</narrative>
  </description>
